  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CORDIO II - Tsunamitill&#xe4;gg</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CORDIO II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main aim of CORDIO is to improve the understanding of consequences and management responses to coral reefs degradation in the Indian Ocean. Research include monitoring of the biological, physical, and socio-economic status of coral reefs, studies on the vulnerability of corals to bleaching, studies on alternate livelihood and management. Networking, education and awarenes are also included.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Totalt 26 projekt kommer att organiseras under ett antal tematiska omr&#xe5;den i Indiska Oceanen. 1)Milj&#xf6;&#xf6;vervakning av korallrev, till vilken man kopplar 2)forskningsprojekt, 3)kapacitetsuppbyggnad och 4)informationsspridning. F&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra 5)f&#xf6;rvaltningen av korallrev, 6)alternativa inkomster f&#xf6;r befolkningen i kustzoner samt p&#xe5;verka 7)policies genom ett &#xf6;kat deltagande i internationella n&#xe4;tverk.</narrative>
  </description>
